{"4603290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Autumn Crunch", "steam_appid": 4603290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean Up While Enjoying the Views!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as a diligent little robot to vacuum fallen leaves, mow overgrown grass, and leave a quiet autumn town shipshape.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603290/extras/c603f138d81311349b081f554f58abc9.poster.avif?t=1779026669\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603290/extras/c603f138d81311349b081f554f58abc9.webm?t=1779026669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603290/extras/c603f138d81311349b081f554f58abc9.mp4?t=1779026669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear Every Leaf:</strong> Vacuum up every last fallen leaf and mow down every patch of overgrown grass — leave no corner untouched.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Equipment:</strong> Take on bigger jobs and get them done faster as you improve your gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Help Out:</strong> Explore the town, collect hidden items, and take on odd mini quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always Something New:</strong> Work across different locations, times of day, and weather conditions — no two shifts look quite the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603290/extras/9c472e71b8ee842511d54439c97e58e4.poster.avif?t=1779026669\" width=1170 height=658 ><sour